# Game feel / juice

When polishing movement, dig impact, land/jump, pickup feedback, Harvest/Standing notices, siphon feedback, or Hollow presence:

1. Read [`docs/game-feel-best-practices.md`](docs/game-feel-best-practices.md) before adding juice.
2. Prefer subtle, Act 1 secrecy tone — not arcade carnival.
3. Do not juice broken systems; fairness (e.g. coyote/buffer) before spectacle (freeze/shake).
4. Cap digs quieter than Pit; social consequences stay UI/copy-led, not explosion FX.
